# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FORGE — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys.
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real credentials.
#
# CLOUD MODE (best quality):
#   Required:    ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   Recommended: PERPLEXITY_API_KEY, SERPAPI_API_KEY
#
# OPEN-SOURCE MODE (free, good quality):
#   Required:    At least one of: GROQ_API_KEY, GOOGLE_API_KEY, or Ollama running locally
#   Optional:    GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD for email alerts
#   No cost:     Skip ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, PERPLEXITY_API_KEY, SERPAPI_API_KEY entirely
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Cloud LLM (skip if using OSS mode) ───────────────────────────────────────

# Anthropic Claude API key — required for cloud mode tailoring + people intel
# Get one at: https://console.anthropic.com/
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...

# Perplexity API key — cloud ghost job detection, salary intel, council review
# Get one at: https://www.perplexity.ai/settings/api
# PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=ppl-...

# ── Cloud Discovery (skip if using OSS mode) ──────────────────────────────────

# SerpApi key — cloud Indeed/LinkedIn/Google job scraping
# Get one at: https://serpapi.com/
# SERPAPI_API_KEY=...

# ── OSS LLM providers (free — use instead of Anthropic) ──────────────────────

# Groq API key — free tier, 1,000 req/day, Llama 3.3 70B
# Sign up at: https://console.groq.com (no credit card required)
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# Google AI Studio API key — free tier, 250 req/day, Gemini 2.5 Flash
# Get one at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (no credit card required)
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIza...

# Mistral AI API key — free 1B tokens/month on La Plateforme
# Sign up at: https://console.mistral.ai (phone verification, no credit card)
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=...

# Ollama runs locally — no API key needed. Install at: https://ollama.com
# After installing: ollama pull llama3.1:8b
# (Ollama is auto-detected when running at http://localhost:11434)

# ── Email and alerts (optional for both modes) ────────────────────────────────

# Gmail App Password — enables discovery email digest and Gmail alert scraping
# Generate at: Google Account > Security > 2-Step Verification > App passwords
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=...

# LanguageTool API key — grammar checking (free public endpoint used if blank)
# Free tier at: https://languagetool.org/editor/settings/api
# LANGUAGETOOL_API_KEY=
